WEBVTT

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:42.420
It's Eriko!

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:44.410
She had a spare key to that Z?

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:48.660
The harbor?

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:53.790
She's driving towards the harbor?

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:54.960
Don't tell me, she's...

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:03.450
<i>I'm the one who found this car.</i>

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:08.220
She's going to sink it in the ocean?!

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:15.890
D-Don't!!

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:22.460
<i>Enchanted People</i>

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:04.990
Why?

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:12.090
Why Tatsuya...!?

00:03:14.410 --> 00:03:18.760
Even Tatsuya wants to save the Devil Z!

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:29.880
Why...!?

00:03:34.550 --> 00:03:40.520
<i>In the end, the person bewitched by the Devil Z was you.</i>

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:05.960
Kitami-san?

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:08.580
You must be the BlackBird.

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:13.600
Is this the scratch caused by hitting the Z at the harbor?

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:15.110
Reina told me about it.

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:17.230
I've got a question for you...

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:20.020
Did you tuned the Devil Z?

00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:21.100
Yeah, it was me.

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:24.400
Can you do me a favor, Kitami-san?

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:27.490
Ok...

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:33.320
I see...

00:04:33.320 --> 00:04:35.540
you're used to it.

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:39.040
You're very skilled and know just how to run on this place.

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:45.570
But... there's something wrong with the car.

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:49.260
The steering is vague when you're over 250km/h...

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.150
there's a lack of horsepower too.

00:04:57.450 --> 00:05:01.160
I see... it's pretty good overall.

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:04.190
The dealership knew a bit about Porsches.

00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:07.080
They've tuned the performance from the base model...

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:09.710
and put the sports engine and wheel package on.

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:16.290
Alright, let's see what happens if we add 100hp.

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:19.670
You still want to get it to 800hp, right?

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:21.630
By bolting on a twin turbo....

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:22.960
Is that ok?

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:25.470
Please.

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:30.270
The Porsche is a great base car... I'm looking forward to the result.

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:43.040
<i>This is the final call for passengers of Continental
Airlines flight CO 571 to London, departing at 14:20.</i>

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:44.520
Goodbye.

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:45.900
Yeah, take care.

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:48.780
Forget about the past and make a fresh start there.

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:51.900
Thank you.

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:44.620
<i>I'll keep it single turbo for now and add a twin later.</i>

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:48.250
<i>Engine's up to 500hp.</i>

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:55.510
<i>A boost of 1.2 will get the speed over 300km/h.</i>

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:58.060
<i>Let me see the acceleration after 260km/h.</i>

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:17.200
How does it feel?

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:20.830
Good... I'm happy with the acceleration in fourth gear.

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:25.460
And about the chassis...

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:31.090
Hey! Not bad... you're getting better as the car's tuned.

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:32.420
Ishida-san?

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:36.580
But, don't compete with the Devil Z yet.

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:39.840
The three of us should race together.

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:44.520
He never learns his lesson, he just wants to run again.

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:47.030
Haven't you just been discharged from the hopsital?

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:51.270
Let's not talk about that. You should understand.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:01.690
How's the chassis now?

00:08:01.690 --> 00:08:05.530
It's good. Better than before and the gears pick up just right.

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:10.710
Not bad.

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:15.210
Compared to Ishida-san's Testa', which has the most horsepower?

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:17.310
I didn't really measured it,

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:18.220
but I'd say the Testa' has more.

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:22.560
This car has 500hp.

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:28.440
The Testa's 5000cc engine loses power at low revs...

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:32.740
but revved to 9000rpm, he'll get around 600hp.

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:39.110
And that engine is incredible.

00:08:39.110 --> 00:08:42.490
I mean, I'm just guessing...

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:46.000
it could end up even more powerful than that.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:51.790
Of all the engines I've put together over the years,

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:53.130
the Testa' is in the top five.

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:55.000
That's at least 100hp difference?

00:08:57.140 --> 00:09:02.810
You must be wondering why I agreed to increase the
horsepower for Ishida-san's Testa' and not for your BlackBird.

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:10.600
I'm gonna have to get to know it for quite some time.

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:13.520
I just hope you don't mind being a little patient.

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:16.570
But, with Ishida it was different...

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:18.650
Just a feeling...

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:25.700
I've tuned up thousands of engines before and I've met
more the 200 men who were obsessed with speed.

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:31.090
I can sense it right away who's gonna
stay further and further away from me.

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:39.090
Even if he's sick, as someone who
drives a sports car... he has no future.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:45.350
I know it's dangerous but I still must make the best car for him.

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:54.560
Hey, Kou-chan, it's me...

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:56.830
Is it almost done?

00:09:57.190 --> 00:09:58.860
Wow, good instincts.

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:01.040
Today, Bankin will finish it.

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:02.880
Speaking of which, Akio...

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:04.570
where are you right now?

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:07.700
At school. Trying to be a good high school student.

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:10.790
<i>What? You?</i>

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:12.080
<i>Come around after school.</i>

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:15.210
I will! See you, Kou-chan.

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:24.640
Damn. It's still having accidents as usual.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:26.640
Not so easy to tame this guy, huh?

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:28.650
It's ok, don't worry.

00:10:31.070 --> 00:10:36.650
I'm serious. Anyone who's obsessed with this car has bad luck.

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:40.040
Yeah, thank you, Kou-chan. I'll be careful.

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:05.570
Let's go... to Wangan.

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:12.110
I think he'll be out there tonight.

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:15.970
Then, tonight it is.

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:21.000
Alright... tonight then.

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:27.040
<i>I have a bad feeling about this.</i>

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:33.610
<i>People are obsessed with that Devil Z...</i>

00:11:37.240 --> 00:11:38.970
<i>Something is going to happen.</i>

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:24.280
Good morning, Koichi.

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:25.240
Good morning.

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:28.390
Breakfast will be ready soon, just wait for a while.

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:29.000
Ok.

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:34.400
<i>At around 02:50am near junction 3 of the Wangan (The Port
Exit) a sports car and a large truck were involved in collision.</i>

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:35.900
<i>The impact severely damaged the sports car, leaving the 19 year old driver concussed. The truck driver wasn't injured.</i>

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:37.890
<i>The highway police are looking into why the two drivers collided. No other vehicles were involved in the crash.</i>

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:38.890
<i>Although it was chaotic for a while, the traffic soon got back to normal.</i>

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:42.400
Here, sorry to keep you waiting.

00:12:50.840 --> 00:12:55.410
Ta-da! Our savings have finally reached 4 million!

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:59.120
Wow, amazing...

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:03.540
We've been working hard for a few years.

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:07.870
You go to work every day and don't spend much.

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:11.470
I worked too before I got pregnant.

00:13:14.090 --> 00:13:18.480
When I think about it, it's like a dream...

00:13:18.910 --> 00:13:21.480
Hey, didn't we agreed not to talk about that again?

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:25.010
Yeah, sorry.

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:34.960
<i>Isn't this great?</i>

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:41.160
<i>Hiramoto-san, where have you been?</i>

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:44.460
<i>Megumi-chan is in the hospital and Ryu-san...</i>

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:54.560
<i>Sorry, Koichi...</i>

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:55.980
<i>Megumi...</i>

00:13:56.570 --> 00:14:00.160
<i>I have lost the baby...</i>

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:09.110
It's been 3 years now Koichi, you don't even have a car.

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:10.400
Yeah.

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:14.990
I was so happy when you gave up racing, 3 years ago.

00:14:15.650 --> 00:14:20.120
I would be alone in the house all night while you were out racing.

00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:24.750
I would always wonder if you were coming back... I was so afraid.

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:28.750
Really? It's been 3 years?

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:31.260
<i>Miyasaki?</i>

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.880
<i>Yeah, let's move over there!</i>

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:36.380
<i>I can open a workshop.</i>

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:39.770
<i>It's the countryside. No one owns a Porsche.</i>

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:41.860
<i>That doesn't matter.</i>

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:44.030
<i>Didn't you say you wanted to go back one day?</i>

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:49.140
<i>But your dream is to open a workshop in the city.</i>

00:14:49.140 --> 00:14:54.110
<i>If I stay here, I'm gonna follow the same old road.</i>

00:14:54.110 --> 00:14:56.110
<i>I want to give up tuning cars.</i>

00:14:56.110 --> 00:14:56.960
<i>I want to have a down to earth life.</i>

00:14:57.810 --> 00:14:58.960
<i>Koichi...</i>

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:03.960
<i>Let's work hard and save money for the dream.</i>

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:05.340
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:15:12.880 --> 00:15:16.470
<i>I hope this happiness will last.</i>

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:21.980
I heard Reina-chan changed the color of the car too?

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:24.990
Yeah, I've sent it for tuning. This time I'm gonna have it white.

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:30.910
That's good. They say white is a lucky color for avoiding accidents.

00:15:31.380 --> 00:15:32.850
Really?

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:37.920
<i>Do you have any stories about luck out there?</i>

00:15:38.740 --> 00:15:39.690
Tune in again next week...

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:40.980
Goodbye.

00:15:40.980 --> 00:15:42.910
Drive Go Go!

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:51.210
And that night, as a result of Akio-kun's Z overtaking the truck, nothing happened...

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:57.230
It's as if he was trying to save Ishida-sensei and BlackBird,

00:15:57.750 --> 00:16:00.340
by taking the crash himself!

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:12.360
Since then, everything changed.

00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:15.420
I don't even know what I want.

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:17.020
I don't have a clue.

00:16:17.020 --> 00:16:18.410
The Devil Z, huh?

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:23.660
Reina-chan... do you care about that Z or the driver?

00:16:24.090 --> 00:16:25.160
Huh?

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:29.170
<i>It wasn't an illusion.</i>

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:34.540
<i>I heard your voice at that moment.</i>

00:16:35.310 --> 00:16:38.090
<i>But... I still couldn't save you.</i>

00:16:39.320 --> 00:16:43.220
<i>You changed direction slightly.</i>

00:16:49.640 --> 00:16:55.110
<i>Why would a devil like you wanna save me?</i>

00:16:56.480 --> 00:16:59.240
Hiramoto, how many times do I have to tell you?

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:01.060
The customer is always right!

00:17:01.060 --> 00:17:05.880
But, the customer doesn't have a clue about cars or tuning...

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:08.410
Just shut up and listen to him.

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:10.380
A paying customer gets the highest respect.

00:17:10.850 --> 00:17:13.490
I understand, I'll keep that in mind.

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:16.800
Hiramoto, you're a good mechanic.

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:19.380
My father appreciates your skill, too.

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:24.400
But, this is the era of solving problems with the latest testers.

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:28.900
A manufacturer just has to do what is has to do.

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:36.400
Or you'll just get left out by the era, like that old guy.

00:17:41.130 --> 00:17:44.420
Sugita-san, let the trainee do it.

00:17:44.420 --> 00:17:46.410
It's ok, I'm fine.

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:47.950
It's ok.

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:48.910
Hey, Haruda!

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:50.330
Yes?

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:55.980
Hey, Hiramoto-san...

00:17:55.980 --> 00:17:57.880
Are you free tonight?

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:59.490
Why?

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:02.110
I finally tuned my TD08!

00:18:02.730 --> 00:18:06.560
Now, it's got much more horsepower!

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:10.650
Well, tuning up the chassis is easier now. I'm up to 450hp.

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:15.490
How much did you paid for that Z31?

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:18.980
Around half a million for the old car.

00:18:18.980 --> 00:18:21.580
But you've spent more than a million tuning it up, right?

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:23.490
What am I gonna do with you?

00:18:27.530 --> 00:18:29.120
I'll be back soon.

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:30.470
Koichi?

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:35.120
Don't worry, I'm a different man now.

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:37.490
I wanna get to see my own child grow up.

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:41.060
I'd like to move to a bigger place when the baby's born.

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:43.550
Be careful, ok?

00:18:44.170 --> 00:18:44.770
Yeah.

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:59.030
What do you think? The power of the TD08 is really direct, huh?

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:01.700
Yeah, it's pretty good for a VG,

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:04.320
but 450hp is a little too much.

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:13.330
It's an R...

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:14.960
Reina!

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:16.790
Akikawa Reina... the presenter!

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:21.840
Hiramoto-san, let's go after her!

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:26.510
No way. You can tell by the way she came up behind us...

00:19:26.510 --> 00:19:28.110
that's no ordinary R.

00:19:28.110 --> 00:19:28.980
It's really quick.

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:32.170
It's ok, change the boost to 1.5.

00:19:33.280 --> 00:19:35.600
Stop! The air to fuel ratio's not gonna be enough!

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:37.430
Ok, ok...

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:38.350
Just go after her!

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:45.930
Did you see that, Hiramoto-san?

00:19:45.930 --> 00:19:47.840
I reckon there must be about 500hp...

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:49.120
in that R.

00:19:55.640 --> 00:19:58.630
<i>Still pulling away, at this speed?</i>

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:09.800
Sorry. I didn't realize it was getting so hot.

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:10.820
It's ok.

00:20:11.330 --> 00:20:13.250
It's not blown the head-gasket...

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:15.690
it's just overheated.

00:20:16.220 --> 00:20:19.160
Why don't you tune the car for me?

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:21.720
Then it'll be so much faster!

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:24.820
No way... I'll help you get it back to it's original state.

00:20:27.510 --> 00:20:31.120
But I'd love to catch up with Reina and talk to her...

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:32.710
about the accident.

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:33.910
Accident?

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:37.170
Yeah, the accident at the Wangan not long ago.

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:39.780
It was in the newspapers.

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:42.040
Those street racers...

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:48.650
I heard Reina was there too.

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:54.060
The car involved was the Devil Z.

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:56.570
Devil Z?

00:21:00.550 --> 00:21:04.690
<i>More than 600hp, over 300km/h.</i>

00:21:04.690 --> 00:21:08.360
<i>Rumor has it, it has a will of its own.</i>

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:13.520
<i>That S30Z will rise again.</i>

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:15.880
<i>Don't you want to beat him, Hiramoto-san?</i>

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:28.900
<i>BlackBird?</i>

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:35.650
Z? Wasn't the Z destroyed?

00:21:39.180 --> 00:21:41.600
Yeah, I'm now on my way home.

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:43.640
I had to do some overtime.

00:21:47.500 --> 00:21:48.280
That's...

00:22:00.720 --> 00:22:03.130
Hey, it's been a long time, missy.

00:22:03.470 --> 00:22:05.460
There... is that?

00:22:06.070 --> 00:22:08.030
Yeah, it's the Z.

00:22:08.030 --> 00:22:09.500
A lot has happened.

00:22:09.500 --> 00:22:11.640
It took a lot of effort to get it here.

00:22:12.750 --> 00:22:15.020
The police talked a lot about it too.

00:22:16.570 --> 00:22:17.510
Can it be fixed?

00:22:17.860 --> 00:22:19.380
Fixed?

00:22:19.380 --> 00:22:21.530
No, I don't think so.

00:22:28.120 --> 00:22:35.470
It was sent to be broken down. I don't want
anyone else becoming obsessed with it.

00:22:36.010 --> 00:22:38.680
So... just let me get rid of it.

00:22:43.220 --> 00:22:45.550
It's better this way.

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:55.680
Let this be the end of it. The Devil Z is dead.
